{
  "model": "module rules\n\ndata AtLeastTwo = String\n    invariant String.length(value) >= 2\n\ndata AtMostThree = String\n    invariant String.length(value) <= 3\n\ndata ExactlyFour = String\n    invariant String.length(value) == 4\n\ndata Between = String\n    invariant String.length(value) >= 2\n    invariant String.length(value) <= 3\n\ndata Positive = Int\n    invariant value > 0\n\ndata NonNegative = Int\n    invariant value >= 0\n\ndata Above = Int\n    invariant value > 10\n\ndata Ranged = Int\n    invariant value >= 1 && value <= 9\n\ndata Even = Int\n    invariant value >= 0 && value /= 5\n\ndata Price = Decimal\n    invariant value > 0.00m\n\ndata Rate = Decimal\n    invariant value >= 0.5m\n    invariant value <= 1.5m\n\ndata Nonempty = List<Int>\n    invariant List.length(value) >= 1\n\ndata Pair = List<Int>\n    invariant List.length(value) == 2\n\ndata Few = List<Int>\n    invariant List.length(value) <= 2\n\ndata Distinct = List<Int>\n    invariant List.allDistinctBy(x -> x, value)\n\ndata Filled = Map<String, Int>\n    invariant Map.size(value) >= 1\n\ndata Small = Map<String, Int>\n    invariant Map.size(value) <= 1\n",
